      "name": null,
      "problem": "A horizontal line $l$ passes through the point $(5,4).$ Calculate the coordinates of the $y$-intercept of $l.$",
      "worked_solution": "On any horizontal line, all points have the same $y$-coordinate.\n\nThe $y$-coordinate of the point $(5,4)$ is $4,$ so the $y$-coordinate of the $y$-intercept is also $4.$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the $y$-intercept are $(0,4).$",
